// How the enemies scale, tuned while the game runs (task 147; areas since
// October 2026). These dials are the whole of it: nothing else makes the
// enemies more, more often or better armed.
//
// The game reads this file again whenever it is saved (BIMS_SCALING names
// another). The next wave laid and the next site's wave count take the
// new numbers; a wave already standing keeps its size. A field left out is
// the built-in value (an area's row left out is the built-in area; a dial
// left out of a row is nought, a wave one), and a file that does not parse
// keeps the last good numbers (the reason is printed on the terminal).
//
// "day" is the day the top bar shows, one on the day the run opens, and a
// row of the map: the run is four areas, one after the other.
//
//   area_0        — an easing the map does not show (its rows are drawn
//                   tier one): the Manufacturers alone, no machine and no
//                   elite; their gear goes from pistols and no armour on
//                   day one to a gun and armour for all of them by the
//                   tier-one area's first day
//   tier_1_area   — the machines' share of every wave goes from none on
//                   its first day to all of it at tier two's door
//   tier_2_area   — every enemy tier two at the least; its days do not
//                   count tier two's door (a trader, the area's first day)
//   tier_3_area   — every enemy tier three; its days do not count the
//                   trader under the Heart, nor the Heart
//   So with 5, 14, 9 and 3: area 0 days 1-5, tier one 6-19, tier two's
//   door 20, tier two 21-29, tier three 30-32, the trader 33, the Heart 34.
//   Tier two comes in from halfway through the tier-one area (a growing
//   share, all of them at the door); tier three the same from halfway
//   through the tier-two area.
//
//   a wave        = (enemies_per_player + every day gone times the
//                   growth_per_day of the area it was in) * players,
//                   rounded down, + enemies_per_bot * bots, rounded up
//                   (1.5 and three bots is five). Bots are the crew's bots,
//                   hands and joiners (never a commander's
//                   reinforcements), and at a defence the site's defenders
//                   too; at an Area defend no bot counts. The count carries
//                   over from area to area: it never jumps.
//
// Each area's row:
//   days            — how many days (rows of the map) the area is
//   growth_per_day  — enemies per player more each day of the area
//   waves           — a site's waves (an elite two at the least)
//   bombers         — Bombers on top of every wave (area 0: none)
//   lancers         — Lancers the same
//   guardians       — an elite's Guardians for each player, in its second
//                     wave (bots do not count; area 0 has no elite)
//   elites          — Bombers on top of an elite's Guardian wave
//   defenders       — the armed defenders who stand with a defended site
//   budget          — waves of the day's size a mission brings in all (a
//                     nest hunt so far), then a trickle of 1 a player; a
//                     row without it reads 4, not nought
//   the Machine Heart is always its own fight, every machine tier three
//
// Only player Bims count as players; bots do not.
//
// The game setup's Difficulty shows every dial as this file has them; once
// the host moves one, the run keeps the setup's (saved with it, dealt to
// every guest). The setup's "Save as default" writes its numbers into this
// file, leaving the comments alone.
// The built-in values: enemies_per_player 2, enemies_per_bot 1.0, and the
// areas 5, 14, 9 and 3 days at 0.2 a day, 1/1/2/2 waves, Bombers 0/1/2 and
// Lancers 0/1/1 (tiers one to three), a Guardian a player from tier one,
// an elite Bomber from tier two, 2/3/5/7 defenders, a budget of 3/4/5/5.
(
    enemies_per_player: 1,
    enemies_per_bot: 0.5,
    area_0: (days: 5, growth_per_day: 0.4, waves: 1, bombers: 0, lancers: 0, guardians: 0, elites: 0, defenders: 2, budget: 3.0),
    tier_1_area: (days: 14, growth_per_day: 0.67, waves: 1, bombers: 0, lancers: 0, guardians: 1, elites: 0, defenders: 4, budget: 4.0),
    tier_2_area: (days: 9, growth_per_day: 0.67, waves: 2, bombers: 2, lancers: 1, guardians: 1, elites: 1, defenders: 6, budget: 5.0),
    tier_3_area: (days: 3, growth_per_day: 0.67, waves: 2, bombers: 2, lancers: 2, guardians: 1, elites: 1, defenders: 8, budget: 5.0),
)
